# Linked worktrees used for isolated verification runs. They are checkouts of
# this same repo, so tracking them makes git treat them as embedded repos (a
# stray gitlink got committed once already). A repo-root `ruff check .` also
# walks them and reports 146 phantom errors.
.worktrees/
